# Poem styles are deprecated
# To use them, the transcriber must count the maximum hierarchy level
# of each poem within Word and choose a *set* of styles to use
# accordingly. We still support them for imports of older documents,
# but recommend Poetry styles instead, and place these on the toolbar/ribbon.
